			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751890401,
					"content": "终于结束了…哼哼，这下我们总算拿到进入那个什么「圣山之心」的「许可」了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890402,
					"content": "「不，我之前说了，这个只是一个『许可』的空壳载体…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890403,
					"content": "「只是拿着这样一个鳞片做成的玩意儿，里面没有任何持有者的信息的话，是没有办法变成『许可』的。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890404,
					"content": "「不然这东西不就变成『只要是龙就能够使用』的万能钥匙了吗…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890405,
					"content": "快，押来一条有身份的龙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751890406,
					"content": "#哪有这样的龙啦…唔，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是龙，不行吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890407,
					"content": "唔嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890408,
					"content": "「它…现在还没有这样的权能。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890409,
					"content": "那现在怎么办？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890410,
					"content": "「在很久之前，在伟大的君主进入圣山之心以后，也有一些具备权力，却未曾激活这一『许可』的家伙。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751890411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				},
				{
					"id": 751890411,
					"content": "「或许，摆放如此显眼的『许可』其实是为此而留…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "秘源龙仆"
				}
			]
		},
